.idea
Chart.lock
/*/**/charts/*
# helm dependency build output (ArgoCD builds dependencies itself). The STUNner wrapper chart
# is the exception: its Chart.lock and dependency archive are committed so the chart contents
# are pinned and a render does not depend on l7mp.io being reachable.
!/charts/stunner/Chart.lock
!/charts/stunner/charts/
!/charts/stunner/charts/stunner-1.2.1.tgz
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.test-logs/
# Profile plugin charts (CI v4 P9.1, plugins/charts/README.md): /*/**/charts/* would ignore every file under
# plugins/charts/. The emqx dependency is vendored like STUNner's, so a render needs no repos.emqx.io.
!/plugins/charts/*
!/plugins/charts/profile-plugin-emqx/Chart.lock
!/plugins/charts/profile-plugin-emqx/charts/
!/plugins/charts/profile-plugin-emqx/charts/emqx-5.8.9.tgz
